     "zh": "发生了什么事？发生，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "happen"
    },
    {
     "en": "What happened?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:event",
    "edge:happen>event",
    "focus:event"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "发生的大事，是事件："
    },
    {
     "en": "event"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:earthquake",
    "edge:news>earthquake",
    "focus:earthquake"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "地球，加上摇动，就是地震："
    },
    {
     "en": "earth"
    },
    {
     "en": "quake"
    },
    {
     "en": "earthquake"
    },
    {
     "zh": "地震时，要躲到结实的桌子下面哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:reporter",
    "edge:news>reporter",
    "focus:reporter"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "拿着话筒采访的人，是记者："
    },
    {
     "en": "reporter"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:report",
    "edge:reporter>report",
    "focus:report"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "记者写的报道。报道，去掉 e r："
    },
    {
     "en": "report"
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得 teach 加 er 是 teacher 吗？report 加 er，就是 reporter。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:exposure",
    "edge:news>exposure",
    "focus:exposure"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "把坏事公开出来，是曝光："
